1
00:00:10,653 --> 00:00:12,274
Dude… you didn't
even wash your hands?”

2
00:00:13,023 --> 00:00:15,023
What the hell are you even doing?”

3
00:00:15,462 --> 00:00:18,180
You're in that state and you still talk like that?”

4
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:21,766
Do you… want me to help or not?”

5
00:00:23,685 --> 00:00:28,127
You already saw it, didn't you? Or what—
you want me to deal with it for you?”

6
00:00:30,408 --> 00:00:32,408
Dude, what the hell are you doing?”

7
00:00:40,264 --> 00:00:42,643
Night—what the hell, man?
What are you doing!?”

8
00:01:05,544 --> 00:01:08,340
Don't stop now. Just…
finish what you started.”
